WEBVTT

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:14.280
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.240
I am Cid, an inventor.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:22.010
Today I will give a short explanation
of the mecha of Wonderland.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.520
Do you have any idea
how these machines work?

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.820
First of all, there is Soil, which can
be found all over Wonderland.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:34.660
It is a wondrous sand that produces different
kinds of energy depending on which kind it is.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:38.820
The energy in Soil is unleashed by
activating it in a spiral motion,

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.530
so it produces an enormous
amount of power

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:42.830
when combined with a driller.

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:47.870
My now-deceased Subway, Elizabeth,
also utilized a Soil mechanism.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:51.650
Oh, in addition, it used a fragment of antimatter,

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:54.650
which was apparently a piece of Omega,

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:56.140
to travel through the dimensional tunnel.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:05.550
I'd love to explain more to you!

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:08.090
Look forward to it in the next episode.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:39.120
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:39.120
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:46.630
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:46.630
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:55.740
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:55.740
With our eyes on the future

00:01:56.210 --> 00:02:01.840
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:01:56.210 --> 00:02:01.840
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:11.480
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:11.480
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:18.990
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:18.990
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:24.700
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:24.700
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:34.200
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:34.200
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:47.160
Welcome to the sea of Wonderland.

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:52.790
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:56.070
One who is a submarine...

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:25.630
My fellow crewmembers!

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:29.700
Teros, where we will find the Flying Water,
is located at the end of the sea.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:32.430
There is no way to know what we may
run into on our way there.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:37.750
However, we must protect Wonderland
from the aggression of Chaos.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:41.580
We must fight to restore order
here in Wonderland,

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:44.140
for we are the honorable Comodeen!

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:51.830
I look back and it has been many years

00:03:49.990 --> 00:03:52.660
I wonder where the kids went?

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:55.290
since we banded together to fight the Earl!

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:59.230
Even after we lost our first
secret underground base,

00:03:57.070 --> 00:04:00.840
Looks like it's going to take a while.

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:03.140
I will never forget what we all
went through together!

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:05.110
Cid can even make things like this submarine!

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:13.650
It is true that they were trying times,
but it only strengthened our faith!

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.410
Yeah, but that Subway of his broke!

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:09.510
Sis!

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:15.850
It's really too bad I didn't get to see even once

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:20.360
In celebration of our new start,
I would like to also renew our spirit

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:18.820
my beautiful Elizabeth, racing along.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:24.550
and present you with
my 125 Rules of Order!

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:24.030
But I guess anything will someday break.

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:30.520
But didn't you make this ship
all by yourself? That's amazing!

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:26.590
Number one!

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:28.460
If you are on the subway,

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:30.520
give up your seat to the elderly!

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:32.960
Number two!

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:34.860
Isn't it, though?!

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:38.210
Jane might look elegant,

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:43.040
but her thick Wonderland alloy armor allows her
to easily go down to depths of five kilometers.

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:47.380
And the huge amount of power that her sixteen
large-scale Elenium condensers produce

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:49.780
is transmitted without any loss of energy
to the perfectly formed screws,

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:50.390
Amazing!
Speed Champion of the Sea!!
is transmitted without any loss of energy
to the perfectly formed screws,

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:53.750
Amazing!
Speed Champion of the Sea!!
which allows for a top speed
of over 500,000 peseta knots.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.550
It's really amazing!

00:04:57.090 --> 00:05:01.760
In addition, thanks to the many attitude
control nozzles placed on the hull,

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.390
she is very easy to pilot!

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:10.000
Even though she is so big, one person can pilot
her with the ease of driving a motorcycle.

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:12.200
Can you believe it?!

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:16.710
So what is everyone doing down there?

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.440
Depth, five hundred!

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:22.840
Let's go!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:27.010
Full speed ahead!

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:30.990
Well, that's just sort of in the spirit of things.

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:33.020
They're the radar guys.

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:37.870
I trust them with some of the
assistant piloting duties,

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:40.960
because it's not like I can sit
in the pilot's seat all the time.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:45.640
Moving along, next I shall explain
to you the special, unique system

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:48.510
used by the submarine to extract
energy from the sea water.

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:52.840
I'll give you guys a special tour
of the engine room!

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:58.540
Oh, I almost forgot, we've got
cleaning duty to take care of.

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:00.720
What are you talking about?

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:02.590
Come on, let's do our best at cleaning!

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:11.970
I am so thirsty

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:13.330
It's really getting bad

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:15.460
It's burning up inside of me

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:18.810
My heart skipped a beat

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:21.710
When I laid eyes on you

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:23.380
It's just like torture

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:24.810
I can't take it

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:26.840
Ever since I fell in love with you

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:30.320
My heart skips a beat whenever

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:32.810
I see a girl with hair like yours

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:36.890
Please, God

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:41.200
Can you please give me wings?

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:44.730
From now on, my thoughts of you

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:46.130
It's so cute, isn't it?

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:47.360
Will only shine and grow stronger

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:50.370
There's so much I want to tell you

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:53.370
There's not enough time left in the world

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:53.240
So creepy cute!

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:56.210
You are now the only person

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:58.550
That my eyes can see

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:01.250
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:04.450
All of these thoughts are too much for me

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:07.390
So I'm just going to spill my guts

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:13.360
Nobody knows the right answer

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:16.160
I'm already celebrating my joy

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:18.530
On the inside

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:21.500
Something is going to start

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:24.240
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:28.340
Let's never lose sight of our dreams

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:29.710
All right!

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:47.660
The seaweed paste in our meals
here is good for the body,

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:50.720
but sometimes it'd be nice to get
some lizard or frog on the menu.

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:54.770
Lizard?!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:58.870
A sea hare wouldn't be bad either.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.780
As if that would happen.

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:02.740
I'd settle for a king cobra.

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:09.950
You three sure didn't eat that much.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.880
Are you tired or something?

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:16.850
This room is for you two.

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:18.290
Be sure to rest up.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:20.690
All right!

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:23.890
Lisa, you can bunk down with me.

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:25.960
Is there a problem?

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.360
Not at all!

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:32.540
This is the first time we've had our
own room since we left home!

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:35.570
Oh, I'm gonna sleep so well! It's been so long.

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:46.190
I don't want to sleep in the same room as Chobi!

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:48.620
Help me!

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:08.370
Please take a look at this, Your Excellency.

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:12.280
The energy from these floundering
fools trying to survive

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.850
is the necessary fodder to start
up the Ocean Puzzle.

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:19.010
It is definitely on its way here.

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:21.790
Please wait just a while longer now.

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:25.790
We will soon witness the power
of the Ocean Puzzle!

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:35.170
Quite nice, Lord Pist.

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:38.900
I wonder if that toy of Pist baby's
will really help us at all?

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:43.640
Hurry up and use that thing to fill my stomach!

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:38.530
Oh, I can't stand this!

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:41.070
I want to see the sky!

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:43.000
Please don't ask the impossible.

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:46.310
On the ocean's surface, Elenium discharge
levels are off the charts right now,

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:47.770
so it's very dangerous up there.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:50.080
Plus, with the storm up there,

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:52.050
you wouldn't be able to see the sky anyway.

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:55.040
Yeah, but we've been down here for a week now!

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:57.220
I feel like I'm going to suffocate!

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:58.880
You know what I mean, Yu?

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:08.130
I wonder if we're getting any closer
to seeing our parents?

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:19.070
Don't worry, I'm sure you'll see them again.

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:23.110
Yeah, I'm sorry.

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:26.670
You've also got your boyfriend to find.

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:29.570
Sorry for making you worry.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:38.190
That laugh of yours is weird somehow.

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:40.160
Are you trying to flatter us?

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:42.820
No, it's not like that at all!

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:53.100
I'm getting a very bad feeling about something!

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:56.500
What in the world are you doing?!

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:59.010
Don't waste our time with your silly gibberish!

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:01.620
Fungo has a highly developed sixth sense.

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:04.310
So exactly what kind of
feeling is it that you have?

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:14.190
I don't know.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:53.830
At last, the energy units for the
Ocean Puzzle have come!

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:57.270
It is now time to activate the Ocean Puzzle!

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:24.760
Touch their pitiful lives and move,
Ocean Puzzle!

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:27.770
Entrap these sacrificial victims in your maze

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:30.430
and have them wander, lost for eternity!

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:40.080
The spirits floating around here
are really going crazy!

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:47.320
What's going on here?!

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:52.890
This looks pretty bad.

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:56.730
Up the trim! I'm going to use full
power to get us out of here!

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:03.870
It's useless! My controls aren't responding!

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:11.410
Checkmate.

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:14.740
The target can no longer flee.

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:31.660
Something is coming at us from up ahead!

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:34.290
It's really huge!

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:41.480
What is it?

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:43.200
I don't know!

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:44.830
Is that the cause of the impact we felt earlier?

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:47.940
If we collide with it again...

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:51.210
Jane is really in trouble now.

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:54.380
All hands, get to your
battle stations immediately!

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:00.960
We're going to attack!
Prepare the blow cannon!

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:25.890
I've got it in my sights!

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:28.410
Take in a deep, strong breath!

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:33.390
Exhale!

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:55.610
All right!

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:20.500
Don't tell me that was the end of it.

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:26.480
Don't be ridiculous, the true show
has yet to begin!

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.250
I was away from Gaudium for a long time,

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:31.550
while I poured my heart into perfecting
and fine-tuning the Ocean Puzzle.

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:36.660
Unlike Herba's petty monsters and
makeshift measures at her mansion,

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:39.920
something of this scale requires
a lot of preparation.

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:43.160
Pist baby, you meanie!

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:44.690
I'll totally Hughug you!

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:48.790
Quite nice, Lord Pist.

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:54.300
That's fine, just hurry up and fill my stomach!

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:56.900
At once, Your Excellency.

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:03.010
There's something up ahead of us.

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:06.490
That's...

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:14.920
Kaze!

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:16.900
Is he all right?!

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:18.590
No clue.

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:22.040
This gives us a chance to use one
of Jane's special abilities!

00:17:23.340 --> 00:17:25.130
This is the perfect time for the Crab Hands!

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:37.850
He's not breathing!

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:40.750
We've got to do something!

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:43.150
That's right! CPR!

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:48.060
Lisa, why don't you try doing to him the
same thing you used to save Sis that time?!

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.330
Who, me?!

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:55.460
Lisa, that's your specialty, isn't it?!

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:58.060
Hurry! Kaze is going to die!

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:01.740
But...

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:06.670
All right, that's enough!
In that case, I'll do it!

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:23.790
So you can breathe again now!

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:28.530
Thank goodness, right?

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:42.020
Welcome all to my dimensional maze,
from which there is truly no escape,

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:44.010
the Ocean Puzzle!

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:50.050
I will be your host, Pist Sharws the 11th!

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:54.690
I have been eagerly anticipating your arrival.

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:57.190
What do you plan to do to us?!

00:18:57.930 --> 00:19:01.300
Hey there, don't get your panties in a bunch.

00:19:01.440 --> 00:19:06.960
All I'm thinking of doing is offering
you guys a little entertainment.

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:10.430
I don't care, release us immediately!

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:16.110
Okay! First, I will explain the rules to you!

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:19.750
This is the Ocean Puzzle.

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:24.560
Each of the little cubes is made of
a fragment of a different world.

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:29.460
This, here, is the submarine
that you are so proud of.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:33.760
Every time you clear an
attraction in a cube,

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:39.230
the Ocean Puzzle will move and
you will get closer to the exit.

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:42.080
But!

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:43.600
If you cannot clear the attractions,

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:48.510
your submarine will quickly
begin to drop down

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:51.480
until you eventually break through
the bottom of Wonderland,

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:54.650
where you will be consumed by Chaos!

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:58.050
By Chaos?

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:00.120
Consumed?

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:03.690
Well then! Are you ready?!

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:09.090
Please be sure to have fun with
my incredibly cool attractions!

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:22.550
This is horrible!

